WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.410
In Buenos Aires, your site shows its
spring product update only in English.

2
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:10.310
Sanity stores the article as one
English document with no language field.

3
00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:14.640
General Translation lets you click
Translate on a Sanity document with the

4
00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.230
gt-sanity plugin.

5
00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:23.410
Add gtPlugin to sanity.config.ts
with your locales and document types.

6
00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:28.550
Give the article a language field, and
store your API key in a private document.

7
00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:30.750
Click Translate on the article,

8
00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:34.330
and the plugin imports each
translation as a draft.

9
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.650
Publish the drafts, then query each
language by its language field.

10
00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:43.010
Chinese, Japanese and Spanish readers
now each get their own article.
